  "steps": [
    "Place a saucepan over a medium heat. Add the green curry paste and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly until the paste separates slightly.",
    "Add the coconut milk and the measured boiling water and bring to the boil. Add the instant noodles, their seasoning packets and the green beans to the saucepan. Cook for 2–3 minutes until the noodles are tender.",
    "Season with the lime juice, then cut any leftover lime into wedges to serve.",
    "Sprinkle with chilli slices, beansprouts and basil, if using."
  ],
  "notes": "Curry paste is such a versatile ingredient — using a shop-bought one is actually cheaper than making your own."
}
